Changes:
 light-locker (1.8.0-3ubuntu4+unity3) resolute; urgency=medium
 .
   * d/p/0005: GetActive answers true while the session is locked, not only
     while the screen is blanked; ActiveChanged is sent once per change of
     that combined value, so an unblank under the lock no longer reports
     "not active". The lock is reported to logind (SetLockedHint), and the
     hint is cleared once at start.
